<section class="entry-card entry-plan-card" data-entry-plan-card>
  <div class="entry-card-head">
    <div>
      <span>入场计划</span>
      <h2>价格与纪律</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="entry-price-grid">
    <article>
      <span>当前价</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="current_price">待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>入场区间</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="entry_range">待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>止损位</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="stop_loss">待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>止盈1</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="take_profit_1">待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>止盈2</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="take_profit_2">待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>盈亏比</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="risk_reward">待复核</strong>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="entry-plan-notes">
    <p><b>仓位建议</b><span data-entry-field="position_advice">等待查询</span></p>
    <p><b>跟踪周期</b><span data-entry-field="tracking_cycle">等待查询</span></p>
    <p><b>操作纪律</b><span data-entry-field="discipline">跌破止损应严格执行纪律。</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="entry-trend-grid">
    <article>
      <span>价格位置</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="price_position">待判断</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>量能信号</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="volume_signal">量能待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>均线结构</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="ma_structure">均线待补充</strong>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>走势状态</span>
      <strong data-entry-field="technical_state">待补充</strong>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
